# RegaloApp – Group Gifting MVP

El objetivo es completar cada actividad paso a paso, pero antes debemos crear estrategia de desarrollo.

## Backbone (Main Activities)
- [ ] Group Creation (Setup)
- [ ] Invitation & Access (Onboarding)
- [ ] Coordination & Chat (Communication)
- [ ] Payment Management (Core Value)
- [ ] Notifications (Engagement)

---

## Release 1 – MVP (Validation)
**Goal:** Enable a group to organize, chat, and track payments manually but accurately.  


### Activity 1: Group Creation

#### [US 1.1] Create Group
- [ ] Story: As a Group Creator, I want to create a new gift group with a name and total price.
  - [ ] AC 1: User can input Gift Name (max 50 chars)
  - [ ] AC 2: User can input Total Price (numeric, positive)
  - [ ] AC 3: Group is created with Creator as Admin and status "Active"

---

### Activity 2: Invitation & Access

#### [US 2.1] Invite Users
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to invite users by username.
  - [ ] AC 1: Search field for usernames
  - [ ] AC 2: Invited users appear in a "Pending" list
  - [ ] AC 3: Cannot invite the same user twice

#### [US 2.2] Accept / Reject Invitation
- [ ] Story: As an Invitee, I want to view gift details before accepting.
  - [ ] AC 1: Invitation screen shows who invited, gift name, total price
  - [ ] AC 2: "Accept" adds user to group and chat
  - [ ] AC 3: "Reject" removes invite; user does not join

---

### Activity 3: Coordination & Chat

#### [US 3.1] Group Chat
- [ ] Story: As a Member, I want to send and receive messages.
  - [ ] AC 1: Messages appear in chronological order
  - [ ] AC 2: Sender name and timestamp visible
  - [ ] AC 3: Real-time updates (no refresh needed)

---

### Activity 4: Payment Management

#### [US 4.1] Automatic Price per Person Calculation
- [ ] Story: As a Member, I want to see exactly how much I pay automatically.
  - [ ] AC 1: System displays "Price per person"
  - [ ] AC 2: Formula = Total Price / (1 Creator + Accepted Members)
  - [ ] AC 3: Updates immediately when a member joins or is removed

#### [US 4.2] Manual Payment Tracking
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to mark members as Paid.
  - [ ] AC 1: Checkbox/toggle next to each member
  - [ ] AC 2: Only Creator can change status
  - [ ] AC 3: Status changes visible immediately to all members

---

## Release 2 – Flexibility & Smart Adjustments
**Goal:** Handle real-world changes (price updates, members leaving)

### Activity 1: Group Creation (Edit Mode)

#### [US 1.2] Edit Gift Details
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to edit gift name or total price.
  - [ ] AC 1: Edit button visible only to Creator
  - [ ] AC 2: Changing price recalculates price per person
  - [ ] AC 3: System message in chat: "Laura updated the price to 150€"

### Activity 2: Invitation & Access (Management)

#### [US 2.3] Remove Member
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to remove a member who backed out.
  - [ ] AC 1: Remove option visible only to Creator
  - [ ] AC 2: Removed user loses access to chat
  - [ ] AC 3: Price per person updates automatically

### Activity 4: Payment Management (Visuals)

#### [US 4.3] Payment Progress Bar
- [ ] Story: As a Member, I want a visual progress bar for payments.
  - [ ] AC 1: Shows % Paid Members / Total Members
  - [ ] AC 2: Turns green when 100% is reached

---

## Release 3 – Automation & Closure
**Goal:** Reduce friction and close the loop

### Activity 4: Payment Management (Facilitation)

#### [US 4.4] Payment Link Sharing
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to add a payment link for easy payment.
  - [ ] AC 1: Optional Payment Link field in settings
  - [ ] AC 2: Clickable and visible to all members
  - [ ] AC 3: System validates URL format

### Activity 5: Closure & History

#### [US 5.1] Close Group
- [ ] Story: As a Creator, I want to close the group after birthday.
  - [ ] AC 1: "Close Group" available only when 100% Paid
  - [ ] AC 2: Group moves to History tab
  - [ ] AC 3: Chat becomes read-only

#### [US 5.2] Gift History
- [ ] Story: As a User, I want to see past gifts.
  - [ ] AC 1: Past Gifts section/tab
  - [ ] AC 2: Shows Gift Name, Date, Recipient, Final Price

---

## Summary
- MVP: Core flow + automatic calculation  
- Release 2: Flexibility & error handling  
- Release 3: Quality of life (payment links + history)


